contentMarkdown:
This case is made of a wonderful waxed leather, the kind of leather that only never age. It has a beautiful pull-up and a soft touch. It’s a medium firmness, making it the ideal kind of leather for a laptop case.

The 2 initial orders were made for a 13 and 14” MacBook Pro, but you can ask for a custom size anytime. The 13” size can hold an iPad pro 10” and has a bit of room for the pencil and a cable on the side of it.

This model has a small pocket on the front part, a flap closing end, and a main slot to slip your laptop inside.

The front pocket has enough room to put a cable, a notebook and some pens. If you buy this good, you’ll get 2 [Clippy](notion:bec0a214d2d845b1877a4aceab420790) for free.

## “Pelle” Certificate

{{image:1}}
This version of leather product comes with a first grade leather, a tannery from Toscany (Italy) that respects the [Consortium Manifesto](notion:4a58a7b015244c8ea0d583c45532c0d3). It’s proof of quality, and respect for nature.

## Making-of video

If you are interested in how I’ve made this wonderful case, find more in this video.

And if you are a maker and want to reproduce this case, you can find the [pattern available here](https://shop.crofte.fr/b/leather-macbook-pro-14-sleeve-pattern).

